  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, I took a look at the new Groups feature in the open Beta and it's fantastic from what I've seen so far, however I had a thought about one element.\n\nThe group instances simply being an instance type is great, but when I first read it I got a little excited that it might be a single instance that we can allow members of the group to join at their leisure, even if it's empty.\n\nThat way a group can have its own private instance as a form of meeting ground. I think this would be handy as a sort of group hub world! Maybe let each group only have 1 etc or something similar.\n\nThat's my suggestion, and I hope anyone reading this has a great day! ^^",
